Subject: [PATCH 3329/3799] soh: rename D_801333E4 -> sUnusedSfxValue1

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: an s32 already commented unused that nothing in the tree reads
Defined in soh/src/code/audio_sfx.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/audio_sfx.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/code/audio_sfx.c b/soh/src/code/audio_sfx.c
index e04fe581b..b63073a7d 100644
--- a/soh/src/code/audio_sfx.c
+++ b/soh/src/code/audio_sfx.c
@@ -98,7 +98,8 @@ Vec3f gSfxDefaultPos = { 0.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f }; // default pos
 
 f32 gSfxDefaultFreqAndVolScale = 1.0f; // default freqScale
 
-s32 D_801333E4 = 0; // unused
+// LLM generated name (GUESS), was D_801333E4: an s32 already commented unused that nothing in the tree reads
+s32 sUnusedSfxValue1 = 0; // unused, was D_801333E4 [LLM:GUESS]
 
 s8 gSfxDefaultReverb = 0; // default reverbAdd
 
